### First: start backend with npm run dev; requires MongoDB Atlas.
GET http://localhost:3001/info

### List persons
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons

### Create a valid person (unique name required)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test Contact", "number": "040-12345678" }

### Validation error: invalid phone number
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Invalid Example", "number": "12345" }

### Replace the ID below with the one returned by POST
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### Update the number
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/persons/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{ "number": "040-87654321" }

### Delete the contact
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/persons/REPLACE_WITH_ID
